### Fluxo principal
```
OPEN → IN_PROGRESS → CLOSED
```

### Fluxos alternativos
```
IN_PROGRESS → OPEN    (cliente responde — retorna à fila do Admin)
OPEN → CLOSED         (cliente cancela sem aguardar resposta)
```

